Z||000007||wkayl||10-01-2000||12:21 AM||||Babygirl, thats why it is nice to own a Fiero.  Everyone loves their car and no one can fault them for it.  My son's first car was an 84SE.  When he started looking for a car just before his 16th birthday 2 1/2 years ago he was looking at Comaros and Mustangs.  He saw a Fiero and that was it.  I thought, lets see, 4 cyl auto 2 seater, and still sporty.  Sounds fine with me.  ||||reg||1
